    "question": "Delores has $450. She buys a computer for $400 and a printer for $40. How much money, in dollars, does Delores have left?",
    "gold": "10",
    "answer": "The computer and printer cost 400+40=<<400+40=440>>440 dollars.\nDelores has 450-440=<<450-440=10>>10 dollars left.\n#### 10"
