  "generation": {
    "text": "To determine how much money Delores has left after her purchases, we need to follow these steps:\n\n1. Start with the total amount of money Delores has initially.\n2. Subtract the cost of the computer from the initial amount.\n3. Subtract the cost of the printer from the remaining amount after buying the computer.\n\nLet's go through the calculations step by step:\n\n1. Delores starts with $450.\n2. She buys a computer for $400. So, we subtract $400 from $450:\n   \\[\n   450 - 400 = 50\n   \\]\n   Now, Delores has $50 left.\n3. She then buys a printer for $40. So, we subtract $40 from the remaining $50:\n   \\[\n   50 - 40 = 10\n   \\]\n   Now, Delores has $10 left.\n\nTherefore, the amount of money Delores has left is \\(\\boxed{10}\\).",
